<title>NIGERIA: Nigerian weekly forex demand soars to $109.82 mln.</title>
<headline>Nigerian weekly forex demand soars to $109.82 mln.</headline>
<dateline>LAGOS 1997-05-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nigeria's Central Bank on Friday announced sales of foreign exchange at weekly auction.</p>
<p>				2 May		   25 April</p>
<p> AMOUNT SOLD	    $109.82 million	    $62.490 million</p>
<p>DOLLAR EXCHANGE RATE    85 naira	     85 naira</p>
<p>--Lagos newsroom +234 1 263 03 17</p>
</text>
